OL,3,GNEWSADrivers urged not to risk ignoring
OL,4,Adiversion for landslip work
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers have been urged to follow a
OL,7,Fsigned diversion after a south of
OL,8,FScotland road was shut by a landslip.
OL,10,FThe B740 north of Sanquhar has been
OL,11,Fclosed at Orchard Farm while emergency
OL,12,Frepairs are carried out.
OL,14,FDumfries and Galloway Council has asked
OL,15,Fdrivers not to be tempted to move
OL,16,Fbarriers, enter the work area or to try
OL,17,Fand bypass the closure.
OL,19,FIt said the condition of the road and
OL,20,Fthe heavy machinery in the area made
OL,21,Fany unauthorised access "extremely
OL,22,Fdangerous".
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
